JAGS@.50 additionally requires matched-pair QA success. We report t = 0.50 t=0.50 . All values are expressed as percentages. Cross is Cross-view Recovery; Map Rel. is Map Relation; Temp. Rec. is Temporal Recovery; Temp. Rel. is Temporal Relation. Crossview N=201; Map Relation N=185, Decision N=161; Spatial Relation N=868, Motion State N=1109, Temporal Recovery N=29, Temporal Relation N=438.

